Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:37:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/65] Port H028+$0D36: load the character screens charS/charT

Port H028+$0D36 and $0C68 (load charS.LBM and charT.LBM once, copy
their palette to H005+$522E) and the H041 sized allocator ($000C,
$004A, $00BE) used for their planes. dax_test now links h041.c and
stubs the ILBM reader.

Create New Character now continues after the name and stops at the
unported H047+$00E6.

